    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the mid‑1960s, the Guggisberg Cheese Company invented Baby Swiss cheese just outside Charm.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charm%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A short drive from Charm lies the Guggisberg Swiss Cheese factory, its gift shop, and the Chalet in the Valley Restaurant.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
